; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Compiler_Diab.c	   129  /*! \brief         branch island for mem fault exception vector
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Compiler_Diab.c	   130   *                 it switches the stack and calls Os_Hal_MemFault
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Compiler_Diab.c	   131   *                 the parameter passed to Os_Hal_MemFault are
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Compiler_Diab.c	   132   *                    D4: exception class and TIN (already prepared by exception vector handler)
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hal_Compiler_Diab.c	   133   *                    D5: current PCXI value
